about=masthead('About Cyclonite Tech','Naval experience.<br>Practical expertise.','Specialist underwater expertise, grounded in experience and clear planning.','crew')+f'''<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="reading">{heading('Our company','A specialist team,<br>built around experience.')}<p>Cyclonite Tech is a Malaysian business registered with SSM and based in Seri Manjung, Perak. Our five core crew and 11 contract divers are former Royal Malaysian Navy Clearance Divers with at least 10 years of experience.</p><p>Each diver is certified ADAS Part 3 and qualified in EOD, underwater welding and underwater demolition.</p></div>{stats()}</div></section><section class="section dark"><div class="container">{heading('Our people','Meet our leadership.')}<div class="two-grid"><article class="glass bio"><h3>Mohd Khairul Hafiz</h3><p class="role">Founder, Lead Diver</p><hr><p>16 years Navy Clearance Diver<br>4 years commercial diver</p><ul><li>Master EOD Instructor (IMAS Level 3+)</li><li>Salvage Master</li><li>Underwater Welder</li><li>Underwater Demolition Diver</li></ul></article><article class="glass bio"><h3>Muhd Azmin Abd Rahim</h3><p class="role">Cofounder, Air Diver</p><hr><p>16 years Navy Clearance Diver<br>2 years commercial diver</p><ul><li>Master EOD (IMAS Level 3)</li><li>Underwater Welder</li><li>Underwater Demolition Diver</li></ul></article></div><div class="subsection">{heading('Our approach','How we prepare for every job.')}<div class="principles">'''+''.join(f'<div>{icon(i)}<h3>{t}</h3></div>' for i,t in [('file','Written method statements'),('shield','Exclusion zones & safe standoff'),('team','Contingency plans & emergency readiness'),('equipment','Disinfected gear & sealed suits for potable water tanks')])+f'''</div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container split"><div class="rounded-photo">{img('training','Instructor briefing a group at a training session')}</div><div>{heading('Training & preparation','Experience supported<br>by preparation.')}<p>Clear planning, equipment care and team coordination support our work. Read the capability statement for the documented team experience and service scope.</p>{button('Download Capability Statement','/downloads/cyclonite-capability-statement.pdf','primary','download')}</div></div></section>{cta()}'''
