privacy=masthead('Privacy','Privacy &<br>enquiries<span class="red">.</span>','How this website’s enquiry journey works.','ocean')+f'''<section class="section"><article class="container narrow prose"><h2>Enquiry details</h2><p>The enquiry form prepares a message using the name, company, service, location and project details you enter. The form does not submit these details to a website enquiry database.</p><h2>Continue in WhatsApp</h2><p>When you choose Continue in WhatsApp, your details are included in a link that opens WhatsApp. You can review the draft and choose whether to send it. Share only the information needed to discuss your project.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>WhatsApp and Google Maps links open external services. Their own privacy information applies when you use them. Email and telephone links open your device’s chosen applications.</p><h2>Website delivery</h2><p>The hosting provider processes technical requests needed to deliver the website. This website does not use advertising trackers or analytics scripts. The Contact page embeds Google Maps, which connects to Google when the map loads. Google’s privacy information applies to that service. Portfolio filters and photo controls operate in your browser.</p><h2>Questions about your enquiry?</h2><p>Contact Cyclonite Tech at <a href="mailto:{EMAIL}">{EMAIL}</a> or <a href="tel:+60122929224">{PHONE}</a> to discuss information you have sent to the team.</p>{button('Back to Contact','/contact/','outline dark-outline')}</article></section>{cta()}'''
